From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 22:41:00 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 230/230] Meridian: one agent server, answering to the
 browser's Settings; 0.6.25

A space with its own profile started a second agent server that took over
the connection file, while acting on the main window. Its access prefs, not
the ones in Settings, then decided what an agent could do.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
